# Secrets: never commit keys or tokens
.env
*.key
*token*.txt

# Run outputs: all of it is committed. The team decided on 2026-11-27 to keep the
# whole record in the repo, not just the replies and grades, so that anyone can
# redo the analysis without re-running a model or re-paying the judge. That means
# the run logs, the judge's answer cache and the superseded pre-fix grades go in too.
#
# Two things are still left out, and only these two:
#   - lock files, which hold a dead process id and nothing else
#   - the scratch output folders below, which no run writes to
runs/*/job.lock
outputs/
pilots/out/

# Stray logs anywhere else stay out; the ones inside runs/ are provenance and go in.
*.log
!runs/**/*.log

# Python and editor files
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.DS_Store

# Claude Code files stay local
CLAUDE.md
.claude/

# Intermediate files of the dataset build (see dataset/README.md)
draft.jsonl

# Editor and test caches
.vscode/
.idea/
.pytest_cache/
